# Page-scale eval examples derived from copyrighted technical books — the
# earnings_statement task's pages ARE committed (public disclosures);
# technical_book and contents_page pages are entirely book-derived, so
# neither directory has anything committable in it at all. Regenerate
# locally: point the PLAINLY_*_PDF env vars in eval/build_page_set.py at
# local copies, then run it. (Reorganized 2026-09-21 from a flat
# eval/pages/ into eval/tasks/<task>/pages/ — see eval/tasks/README.md.)
eval/tasks/technical_book/pages/*.yaml
eval/tasks/contents_page/pages/*.yaml
